{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>昨日網民發現呂慧儀與張景淳同日於社交媒體發布在電視城開工照片，引發外界瘋傳兩人合體參演處境劇《愛．回家之三代同 …</p><p></p>\n<p>昨日網民發現呂慧儀與張景淳同日於社交媒體發布在電視城開工照片，引發外界瘋傳兩人合體參演處境劇《愛．回家之三代同糖》救亡。這對備受觀眾期待經典螢幕情侶突然雙雙現身公司，隨即掀起極大迴響。二人這次秘密回歸背後真正原因最終令一眾劇迷大感意外。</p>\n<h2>呂慧儀張景淳同日發布開工照惹熱議</h2>\n<p>處境劇《愛．回家之三代同糖》近期經歷陣容變動，女主角吳若希被安排離開劇組後，電視台陸續召集舊班底如歐瑞偉及沈可欣等演員加入參與新劇拍攝。昨日網民在社交平台限時動態中，赫然發現呂慧儀及張景淳先後上載自拍照，兩人不僅發文時間極為相近，照片背景更是同樣位處電視城之內。由於時間點正值劇組大換血階段，大量截圖隨即在網上瘋狂流傳，被外界視為二人即將以全新身分重返處境劇組強心針。</p>\n<h2>當事人親自揭開現身電視城真正原因</h2>\n<p>面對排山倒海重返處境劇猜測，呂慧儀迅速就開工行蹤作出澄清，證實該次行程完全與《愛．回家之三代同糖》無關。她親自發文解釋是為另一節目進行拍攝：「昨日返公司拍《好嘢港多啲》，開心見到有位好掛住我的姐姐仔，有位都少少掛住我嘅導演哥哥仔，收工有個日日風雨不改企喺大門嘅TVBuddy送我走，即刻回家看愛回家！開心😌。」她更特別點名提及有陪伴吃東西豪仔導演同行，粉碎了外界對龔水合體各種傳言。</p>\n<h2>離開劇組《愛．回家之開心速遞》轉戰教育界</h2>\n<p>自從前作《愛．回家之開心速遞》結束拍攝後，呂慧儀並未有立即接拍新劇集，反而選擇將重心轉移至個人事業發展上。身為教育中心創辦人兼董事她，早前更獲邀遠赴英國劍橋大學出席科技教育峰會，並首次以學界代表身分發表學術演講。她在國際級專家面前分享了如何結合AI技術推動香港K12英語教學實戰經驗，從深入民心螢幕演員成功轉型為學霸老闆，積極發掘演藝以外專業領域。</p>\n<h2>網民對於龔水合體落空深感大失所望</h2>\n<p>真相大白後，大批一直期盼龔水CP合體粉絲紛紛在網絡論壇上表達心聲。不少劇迷對這個戲劇性發展感到落差，留言表示「原來只係拍綜藝節目真係好可惜」、「仲以為可以睇到佢哋再度同框演出」及「空歡喜一場」。不過亦有部分觀眾對呂慧儀轉型及新動向給予正面評價，直指「很高興又有機會看到她的演出」，並讚賞她在教育界發展展現出不同面貌，期待她未來無論在熒幕或教育領域都有更好發揮。\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/05_19843622816a3a130750d89.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/05_19843622816a3a130750d89.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376932998957441_5377199426aeabf72410f8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261103151837984-1103_00862_001_03p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376932998957441_5377199426aeabf72410f8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>呂慧儀張景淳同日發布開工照（圖片來源：張景淳IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376933076334253_17660556506aeabf7313d67.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"bkn-20261103151837984-1103_00862_001_04p.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376933076334253_17660556506aeabf7313d67.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>呂慧儀張景淳同日發布開工照（圖片來源：呂慧儀IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376933150499372_7814218536aeabf73cdea7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"konniecrab_1793699655_4022162972887127162_4705335194.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179376933150499372_7814218536aeabf73cdea7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>呂慧儀為《好嘢港多啲》開工。（圖片來源：呂慧儀I G）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18_9024395016a238f9f0dc4c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"愛回家之開心速遞 龔水cp （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/18_9024395016a238f9f0dc4c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/23_15637966176a1d5f82ddb74.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/23_15637966176a1d5f82ddb74.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%91%82%e6%85%a7%e5%84%80/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">呂慧儀</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%bc%b5%e6%99%af%e6%b7%b3/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張景淳</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e6%84%9b%e5%9b%9e%e5%ae%b6%e4%b9%8b%e4%b8%89%e4%bb%a3%e5%90%8c%e7%b3%96/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">愛回家之三代同糖</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3535776\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 4 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T06:25:16.688555+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1409,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T05:15:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T07:19:07.454613+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T06:18:43.196346+00:00","content_hash":"35508bb0e8b8709e97bda59a71f61e30a9e7288b88c8b8fec605a199a4487578","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}